ter gap-2\">\n  🐟 氷見の寒ブリを味わい尽くす名物料理\n</h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-6\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 text-amber-950 border shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/90 text-stone-800 text-xs flex items-center justify-center font-black shadow-2xs\">1</span>\n      霜降り極上ブリの刺身・握り\n    </h4>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-normal\">脂の乗り切った大トロのような背身と腹身を地元の甘口醤油とわさびで。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50/80 border-emerald-200 text-emerald-950 border shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/90 text-stone-800 text-xs flex items-center justify-center font-black shadow-2xs\">2</span>\n      出汁香る名物ブリしゃぶ鍋\n    </h4>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-normal\">薄切りの寒ブリを出汁に数秒くぐらせ、ポン酢と薬味でさっぱりといただく贅沢。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-sky-50/80 border-sky-200 text-sky-950 border shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/90 text-stone-800 text-xs flex items-center justify-center font-black shadow-2xs\">3</span>\n      富山湾越しの立山連峰絶景露天風呂\n    </h4>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-normal\">晴れた日に海越しに浮かび上がる白銀の立山連峰を眺めながらの名湯入浴。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"sec-hotels\" class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2.5 my-8 flex items-center gap-2\">\n  🏨 楽天トラベルで高評価！おすすめの厳選宿泊施設\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 mb-6\">楽天トラベルの最新クチコミ評価・宿泊プラン料金に基づき、テーマと相性抜群の宿泊施設をピックアップしました。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 md:p-7 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-md space-y-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-3 gap-2\">\n    